 those same fans are mourning the end  of a las vegas legacy  well funeral services will be private  now we know that reaction is pouring  from all over  including one local headliner david  copperfield  on facebook he said he is a pioneer  who together with roy illuminated las  vegas with illusion  christian casadas 8 news now
 

